FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

Article 4

Women and children who are victims of violence receive the following rights:
a. the right to have their dignity respected as human beings; b. the right to health and psychological services from the suffering experienced by victims;
c. the right to legal assistance;
d. the right to obtain information;
e. the right to confidential handling;
f. the right to social rehabilitation;
g. the right to complaint handling;
h. the right of victims and their families to obtain facilities in the judicial process; andi. guarantee of rights related to status as family members and community.

Article 11

