b. health;
c. education;
d. manpower;
e. women's empowerment and child protection;
f. mental and spiritual; and g. peace and order.
2. Prevention of acts of violence by SKPD as referred to in paragraph (1), is carried out in an integrated and sustainable manner.

Article 3

The objectives of protecting women and children from victims of violence are to: a. prevent acts of violence against women and children including trafficking in persons;
b. eliminate all forms of violence and discrimination against women and children;
c. provide a sense of security for women and children who are victims of violence, reporters, and witnesses;
d. provide services to women and children who are victims of violence;
e. facilitate and mediate cases of domestic violence to realize harmonious and prosperous household integrity; andf. empowerment.

